#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:29
msgid ""
"CO-OP: untested third-party mod.  This mod is not bundled with the game and "
"has not been vetted for co-op; it may desync or crash the joining player.  "
"Both players must have the exact same mods installed."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:55
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Moves between the island and the mainland as "
"separate dimensions; co-op shares one world and cannot place the two players"
" in different dimensions."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:60
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Every elevator descent teleports you into a freshly "
"generated instanced level; co-op's single shared map can't hold two players "
"on different levels."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:65
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Leans heavily on teleport spells and scripted "
"(effect-on-condition) effects that don't apply to the remote player, and "
"long-range teleports break the shared map."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:70
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Psionic powers are scripted and run only on your own"
" client; teleportation powers break the shared map and self-heals desync "
"from the host."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:75
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Built on Mind Over Matter, which is not co-op "
"compatible."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:80
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Paraclesian, vampire and dream powers are scripted "
"and run only on your own client, and several mechanics teleport you to "
"separate maps (dream realm, pocket dungeons)."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:85
msgid ""
"CO-OP: NOT COMPATIBLE.  Aftershock's distinctive map specials (the exoplanet"
" start pads, alien biomes) aren't streamed host->client; the joining "
"player's world generates its own terrain at the same coordinates, so the two"
" players stand on completely different maps."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:92
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Inherits Xedra Evolved's scripted powers, which don't "
"apply to the remote player."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:97
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Perk leveling is driven by kill events that aren't "
"credited to the remote player, so the joining player gains no perks."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:102
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Perk bonuses are applied by scripting that doesn't reach "
"the remote player, so the joining player's bonuses won't apply in shared "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:107
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Bionics aren't synced, so a joining player's passive "
"bonuses and active bionic powers won't apply on the host."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:112
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  The mutagen-gland system runs only on your own client and"
" won't sync to the remote player."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:117
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Spell effects run only on your own client; only direct "
"damage reaches the shared world."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:122
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Some scripted effects (e.g. the immortal snail instant-"
"kill) don't apply to the remote player."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:127
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Infection applies correctly, but its status and death-"
"warning UI may not show for the remote player."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:132
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  Pet ownership and control across two players is "
"unresolved; the joining player's tamed pets may be uncontrollable."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:147
msgid ""
"CO-OP: may break.  The scripted intro and the sleep-death mechanic run only "
"on the host and are skipped for the remote player."
msgstr ""

#: src/mp_mod_compat.cpp:152
msgid ""
"CO-OP: minor issues.  Most works, but on-kill style buffs aren't credited to"
" the remote player."
msgstr ""

